+## The API reference is generated, never committed
+
+`site/docs/api/` is gitignored. The deploy installs the workspace at the frozen lockfile, builds
+the packages, and runs `pnpm site:api`: typedoc, configured by the root `typedoc.json`, reads
+every published entry point of the twelve packages (each `src/index.ts`, and every subpath the
